{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43259","headline":"风光草际浮 · 吴秘","name":"风光草际浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草色春沙里，风光晓正幽。\n轻明摇不散，郁昱丽仍浮。\n吹缓苗难转，晖闲叶本柔。\n碧凝烟彩入，红是日华流。\n耐可披襟对，谁应满掬收。\n恭闻掇芳客，爲此尚淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴秘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}